<title>TAJIKISTAN: TABLE-Tajik H1 trade surplus widens to $85 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tajik H1 trade surplus widens to $85 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan's foreign trade surplus widened in the first half of this year to $85.4 million from $33 million in the same period last year, the State Statistics Agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    TAJIK MERCHANDISE TRADE	 Jan-June 97	  Jan-June 96</p>
<p>    Export				   491.4		  317.0</p>
<p>    Import				   406.0		  284.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance			  +85.4		  +33.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
